      "body": "- [x] I, the PR author, have personally reviewed every line of this PR.\n\n# What does this PR do?\n\nFixes the fused mHC cuTile backward for micro-batches whose token count M is below 128 and not a power of two: `_cutile_fused_compute_h_proj_rms_bwd` launched `_ct_scalar_grads_partials_kernel` with `tile_m_scalar = min(128, M)`, which cuTile rejects at compile time (`TypeCheckingError: Invalid argument \"shape\" of load(): Dimension #0 of shape (112, 32) is not a power of two`). The tile is now `min(128, _next_power_of_2(M))`; the loads already use `PAD_ZERO` and the kernel reduces over the tile, so the padded rows contribute nothing.\n\n## Issue tracking\n\nLinked issue: Fixes #7524\n\n## Contribution process\n\n### Pre-checks\n\n- [x] I have added relevant unit tests — `TestFusedProjRmsComputeH::test_fwd_bwd_vs_reference` gains `(112, 4, 2048)` and `(21, 2, 512)`; both fail before this change and pass after it.\n- [ ] I have added relevant functional tests — not applicable (one-line launch-parameter fix).\n- [ ] Determinism test — not applicable: the kernel body and its arithmetic are unchanged, only the launch tile size for M < 128; the existing determinism registration of the fused mHC kernels is unaffected.\n- [x] I have added proper typing to my code — no new symbols.\n- [x] I have added relevant documentation — inline comment explains the constraint.\n- [x] I have run the autoformatter — the change is a single expression and a `parametrize` list; formatted to the repo's line length.\n\n### Validation\n\nOne GB200 (sm_100), nemo:26.08 container (MCore `dev` 43e45e13, cuda-tile 1.6.0rc7), the fix applied on top of the container's file:\n\n```text\n=== [BEFORE FIX] pytest TestFusedProjRmsComputeH\nPASSED [256-4-4096]  PASSED [64-2-512]  PASSED [128-4-2048]\nFAILED [112-4-2048]   TypeCheckingError: Dimension #0 of shape (112, 32) is not a power of two\n=== [AFTER FIX] TestFusedProjRmsComputeH + TestEndToEndFused + TestFusedProjRmsComputeHKeepFp32\n12 passed  (incl. [112-4-2048], [21-2-512])\n```\n\nMotivating failure: DeepSeek-V4 SFT with `use_fused_mhc=True`, unpacked SBHD, MBS 1 on 8 × GB200 died after 7 iterations on a 112-token micro-batch; with the fix the tile for that batch is 128 with one M block.\n",
      "changedFiles": 2,
