      "body": "Gentle ping @FDecaYed @Connor-XY. The fix is unchanged and still applies to current `main` (`fused_mhc_kernels.py` has not been touched since 8b2f660; the `min(128, M)` launch tile is still there), and the two new test cases plus the full `test_fused_mhc_kernels.py` module were confirmed on this head on GB200 (details in #7524). If it is easier to fold the one-line change into #7704 or another mHC PR you are already landing, that works for me too; otherwise I am happy to rebase or adjust anything here.\n",
